{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_12225600","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12225600","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1222560001:0":{"text":"よし、次は俺の番だな。","source_cn":"这次该到我了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75B6B85EFB897C6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222560002:0":{"text":"下がってた方がいいぞ。タシーが俺の願望でどんなスリル満点な光景を作り出すか分かったもんじゃねえからな。滅び行く世界を救う英雄になって登場したりして！","source_cn":"你们小心点，都往后站。不知道塔西会用我的心愿做出多惊险...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14902BF060155B47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1222560003:0":{"text":"おお！本当ですか！？","source_cn":"哇，真的吗？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF9D7B2DDE17D441","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222560004:0":{"text":"ふふ、シンドバッドの夢に入ったことがあるけど。吟遊詩人が唄う伝説の詩編よりも奇想天外な光景だったわよ！","source_cn":"哼哼，我见过辛巴达的梦哦，确实绚烂多彩变化万千，比吟游...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE410E9011F66CC55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222560005:0":{"text":"でも、それは本当にあなたが一番望んでいることかしら？","source_cn":"不过，那真的是你心中最深层的愿望吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x329A36ADD2C2E495","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_